From: u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com (Ben Goodrich)
Date: Mon, 05 Jan 2015 14:30:15 +0000
Subject: Re: Relative efficiencies of multi_normal_cholesky, multi_normal_prec and multi_normal
Message-ID: <o99Gzvy4nt0.QWi-nJxVkVwJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <o99Gzvy4nt0.UiUoVss4OGkJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <o99Gzvy4nt0.UiUoVss4OGkJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
