From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Sun Jan 11 22:30:35 2015
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Sun, 11 Jan 2015 22:30:35 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] n-mixture model in Stan? [marginalizing
Message-ID: <9mMsp1oB69g.78vW13OmE18J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <9mMsp1oB69g.Y25lOsBzOygJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <9mMsp1oB69g.6GU9-qoLwYgJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <9mMsp1oB69g.Y25lOsBzOygJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
