It really helps if you include the definitions of the variables
and what blocks they're in.  Otherwise I have to guess what
everything is or cross-reference elsewhere.

>  with mu a vector[k] parameter and tmp an auxiliary parameter( matrix[N,k]).
> In this case, y must be sampled from  bernoulli_logit(mu[n]), re-coding the loop as
