Subject: Re: [stan-users] Efficient implementation of average predictive comparison (APC, Gelman & Pardoe 2007)?
Message-ID: <NYodG--ecSI.T2BN25tIWoIJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <NYodG--ecSI.UDHKsfc6TiAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <NYodG--ecSI.UDHKsfc6TiAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
