Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: Large ridge regression/hierarchical like model
Message-ID: <8V9kolNnHhM.H1IAYyqce6kJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <8V9kolNnHhM.CF9uI8QBzFMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <8V9kolNnHhM.nmDdAnYpsiMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <8V9kolNnHhM.CF9uI8QBzFMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
