Subject: Sum by group (stan equivalent of R's tapply)
Message-ID: <zRVmkgs7KPg.2V9oZZ6l-J4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/zRVmkgs7KPg/m/2V9oZZ6l-J4J>
