I don't understand what the "to vector..." statement does, since it doesn't seem to correspond with the description in the latest manual. You should note, also, that in the section on concatenation operations (manual pp. 329-30), the descriptions for horizontal and vertical concatenations are exactly the same (i.e., "by columns" and "same number of rows").

