Subject: Re: [stan-users] Ordered Vectors, Prior Distributions, and Efficient Reparametrization
Message-ID: <aN6eFv7Qmo8.UVnRafOA328J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <aN6eFv7Qmo8.SZDs2LmFWFUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
